PRE 4.2.0 (P3): hosted netdev shutdown + shell atexit (register cleanup right after netdev init); netdev authz; ARP tick advances cache age and preserves ms remainder; gratuitous ARP; fl_net_route_configure_static rejects invalid prefix; bare-metal lab netdev stats accessors, PIT ARP poll via IRQ bottom-half. Full loopback paths retained in net_wire_egress/host. Closes #232, #233, #235; partial #237/#240/#241 (no virtio NIC). P3-7 RFC 793 FSM open (#238).
